# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fusion-1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# FXA (EXACTNESS of the combination all, WP0): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-audit = the production profile plus QWEN_FAST_BATCHED_READS=async,
# QWEN_FAST_BATCHED_READS_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_CCL_OPTIONS=rs-c1, QWEN_FAST_CCL_OPTIONS_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DEVICE_ZEROS=1, QWEN_FAST_DEVICE_ZEROS_AUDIT=1,
# QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_GATEUP1=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_GATEUP1_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_HEAD64=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_HEAD64_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_MM_GRID=1,
# QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_MM_GRID_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_PERMUTE=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_PERMUTE_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_QKV1=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_QKV1_AUDIT=1,
# QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_REDUCE=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_REDUCE_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_TAIL=1, QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_TAIL_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_KV_PAGE_WRITER=1,
# QWEN_FAST_KV_PAGE_WRITER_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_LAZY_SHARD_W=1, QWEN_FAST_LAZY_SHARD_W_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_MLP_CFG=g3u4d3, QWEN_FAST_MLP_CFG_AUDIT=1,
# QWEN_FAST_PRESTAGE_DIFF=1, QWEN_FAST_PRESTAGE_DIFF_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_KEYED=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_LEAN=1,
# QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_READ=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_SELECT=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX_FOLD2=1,
# QWEN_FAST_TP4_TWO_BLOCK_PRESTAGE_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_WRITE_PACKED_LEAN=1, QWEN_FAST_WRITE_PACKED_LEAN_AUDIT=1. Every lever of it runs its audit, which compares the served
# composition beside the lever on the device. READ: c2_smoke_check clean under EVERY lever's rule at once (S1 shard argmax (QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX), K/V page writer
# (QWEN_FAST_KV_PAGE_WRITER), MLP streaming config and L1 multiply (QWEN_FAST_MLP_CFG), CCL options (QWEN_FAST_CCL_OPTIONS), WP6 F-F1 drafter local reduce
# (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_REDUCE), WP6 F-F3a drafter SwiGLU and residual kernels (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_TAIL), WP6 F-F3c drafter fused gate|up matmul (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_GATEUP1), WP6 R2
# drafter matmuls on device-width grids (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_MM_GRID), F-F2 drafter permutation kernels (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_PERMUTE), F-F3c fused drafter q|k|v projection
# (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_QKV1), F-F4 one 64-row drafter head (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_HEAD64), WPH-1 pre-stage diff (QWEN_FAST_PRESTAGE_DIFF), WPH-2 lean write_packed
# (QWEN_FAST_WRITE_PACKED_LEAN), WPH-3 batched verify and collect read-backs (QWEN_FAST_BATCHED_READS)): each lever logs its engaged line and an audit line with exact=True,
# no fell-back line, no 'audit mismatch', no stall, every answer complete. ANY mismatch, fallback or missing audit line is NO-GO for the combination: read which lever's
# rule names it, and ablate with the per-lever pack (references/fusion-jobs). every lever that is exact by construction on together, to be timed and audited once before any
# ablation: the drafter permutations, S1 with the tree fold, the drafter reduce, fused q|k|v, tail kernels, fused gate|up weight and device-width matmul grids, the 64-row
# drafter head, the CCL options at the sweep winner rs-c1 (chunks per sync 1 on the unit-major reduce-scatters; exact, 5 of 5 pairs, 16.9 to 14.7 us per call), the K/V page
# writer (its card-M proof passed and is recorded in ordered_writer_evidence_tp4.json: the full run 1976 of 1976 exact, both negative controls fail), the MLP streaming
# config g3u4d3 (card-M sweep: the composed gate, up and down chain 170.4 to 162.1 us per layer, exact), the two engine-start upload levers, the four host-side round-host
# levers, and the three host-gap levers of WPH (the pre-stage diff, the lean write_packed and the batched read-backs as non-blocking copies with one fence) (tp4/round-host:
# the draft selection with its codebook checks made once, the quad readback merge as one batch, the verify-time diff write keyed on the start and page table, the unparsed
# per-phase lines dropped; each declines to the reference whole on any failed check and is exact by its own audit); NOT the fused MLP gate|up (its kernels have never
# compiled on a card). Duration (estimate): 60 minutes. TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py; on the control and the lever legs alike, so the pairs stay
# paired): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip once a second through the smoke step (AICLK and the limiter holding it, power, current, temperature, kernel NOPs);
# read telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the timing, and the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. It reads only (no ARC message, no write) and runs
# on the host: it is not part of any arm.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
